                                                       <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> """The Datasheet Ontology is a vocabulary for a \"proto-semantic\" representation of datasheet contents, intended as a part of the POSC Caesar RDL. The ontology was developed by the DISC collaboration on digitalisation, Q3 2023. Disclaimer: This ontology is based on an earlier, unspecified version of IDO and may include references that are not valid in the latest IDO version. It is published here to give users a starting point and inspiration for how IDO can be applied.""";
